{"tmdb":1401364,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Gema’s suicide attempt brings her three children together after many years, on the eve of an unusually cold Christmas in Guadalajara. Cristina, stubborn and deeply Catholic, sees herself as their mother’s caretaker; Sony, a psychic on the local Latino TV channel, fled as far as she could over twenty years ago and never came back; and Brunito, the much younger one, a frustrated biologist and forty-something gay man still dreaming of finding the love of his life. A cold front moves in and traps them inside the house, threatening to bring back the family’s most painful memory—and place it right on the table.","directors":[{"name":"Eduardo Esquivel","id":2427069}],"cast":[{"actor":"Emma Dib","role":"Cristina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mCmLWy55aeLxztN9kqzhpqv0iTq.jpg","tmdb":989725},{"actor":"Andrés David","role":"Bruno","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8gdFBLhCqVNbUcvUR57jO6WHyZL.jpg","tmdb":5148322},{"actor":"Teresa Sánchez","role":"Sony","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iLzgyVP822PHZCOtNFROi9YSHTJ.jpg","tmdb":1043788},{"actor":"Magdalena Caraballo","role":"Gemma","photo":null,"tmdb":3086715},{"actor":"Ruth Ramos","role":"Tati","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6043w3WOtFSkjw1YGFaP1SItoHr.jpg","tmdb":1731102},{"actor":"Yosi Lugo","role":"La Ceci","photo":null,"tmdb":1317839},{"actor":"Jesús Estrada Escobedo","role":"Quique","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oCoEjwLIE0nm8AiEccy4jXmaax8.jpg","tmdb":5509761},{"actor":"Melissa Rosales Berumen","role":"Mónica","photo":null,"tmdb":5618624},{"actor":"Coralia Manterola","role":"Gema Joven","photo":null,"tmdb":1315870},{"actor":"Aldo Emiliano Navarro","role":"Brunito Niño","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xEurjLLb8VWj5hVinYjfCbrt1QW.jpg","tmdb":5618626},{"actor":"Cristina Rosales","role":"Sony Joven","photo":null,"tmdb":5618627},{"actor":"Lalo Covarruvias Díaz","role":"Ramón","photo":null,"tmdb":5618629}],"trailers":[],"official":null,